    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "משתין בקיר",
      "rationale": "Tok Hibru i tokubit long man: 'man i paitim wara long banis' — em i min olgeta mankilai; ol tanim i redi long 'olgeta man' o 'olgeta mankilai'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "ובערתי \/ יבער",
      "rationale": "Wanem as bilong 'skruapim' i kamap tupela taim — God i skruapim olsem man i skruapim pupu — pasin i wankain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "עצור ועזוב",
      "rationale": "'Holim insait na lusim' — ol i tambu long ples (ol i holim) na ol i stap ausait; ol tanim i toktok 'ol selman na ol fri man'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Olsem, lukim, mi bringim nogut long haus bilong Yaravam, na mi ken katim olgeta man bilong Yaravam i go ausait long ol manmeri bilong en — olgeta man i paitim wara long banis, olgeta man ol i holim insait, na olgeta man ol i lusim — long Yisrael; na mi rausim olgeta bilong haus bilong Yaravam, olsem man i skruapim pupu i go inap olgeta i pinis.",
